# Metadata

Name: pipeline_hazard
Category: computer_architecture/pipeline
Tags: [pipeline, hazard, data-hazard, control-hazard, structural-hazard]
Dependencies: [pipeline_overview, pipeline_register]
Related Skills: [forwarding, stall, bubble, branch_prediction]
